1
00:00:00,559 --> 00:00:03,099
(Sheldon:)I may have left
a suggested organizational schematic...

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:04,980
(Sheldon:)...for her bedroom closet.

3
00:00:05,147 --> 00:00:06,147
PENNY:
Leonard?

4
00:00:06,314 --> 00:00:07,444
This is gonna be bad.

5
00:00:07,607 --> 00:00:10,737
(Sheldon:)Goodbye, Honey Puffs. Hello, Big Bran.

6
00:00:11,194 --> 00:00:13,534
(Penny(entering):)You came into my apartment
while I was sleeping?

7
00:00:13,697 --> 00:00:14,867
(Leonard:)Yes, but only to clean.

8
00:00:15,031 --> 00:00:18,531
Really more to organize,
you're not actually dirty, per se.

9
00:00:18,702 --> 00:00:20,872
(Penny:)Give me back my key.

10
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:22,830
(Leonard:)I'm very, very sorry.

11
00:00:22,998 --> 00:00:25,288
Do you understand how creepy this is?

12
00:00:25,459 --> 00:00:27,499
(Leonard:)Yes, we discussed it at length last night.

13
00:00:27,669 --> 00:00:30,169
In my apartment? While I was sleeping?

14
00:00:30,338 --> 00:00:33,338
(Sheldon:)And snoring.
And that's probably just a sinus infection.

15
00:00:33,508 --> 00:00:37,098
But it could be sleep apnea. You might
wanna see an otorhinolaryngologist.

16
00:00:39,765 --> 00:00:41,555
The throat doctor.

17
00:00:42,726 --> 00:00:46,186
(Penny:)And what kind of doctor
removes shoes from asses?

18
00:00:46,897 --> 00:00:48,067
(Sheldon:)Depending on the depth...

19
00:00:48,231 --> 00:01:00,021
(Sheldon:)...that's either a proctologist,
or a general surgeon.

